---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Meet Bubble Sort | Intro">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-8 py-6 sm:py-10 text-center">
    <div class="inline-block bg-focusBg border border-focusBorder text-focusText text-xs font-extrabold px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">
      Welcome to DSA 101 • Hook Page
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">
      Meet <span class="text-accent font-handwritten text-4xl sm:text-6xl">Bubble Sort</span> 🧼
    </h1>

    <p class="text-textSecondary text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-xl mx-auto">
      Bubble sort, apne style mein — koi tension nahi, sirf comparing aur swapping. 
      Isko "Bubble" isliye kehte hain kyunki sabse bada item paani mein bubble ki tarah upar (end par) तैर kar pahunch jata hai!
    </p>

    <div class="bg-card border border-textSecondary/20 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4 shadow-sm text-left">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-main flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>💡</span> Hum Kya-Kya Seekhenge? (5 Quick Steps)
      </h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-main font-medium">
        <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-focusBg border border-focusBorder text-focusText font-extrabold text-xs flex items-center justify-center">1</span>
          <span><strong>List Basics:</strong> Line/Array ke fundamentals.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-focusBg border border-focusBorder text-focusText font-extrabold text-xs flex items-center justify-center">2</span>
          <span><strong>Comparison:</strong> 2 bagal waale doston ke scores compare karna.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-focusBg border border-focusBorder text-focusText font-extrabold text-xs flex items-center justify-center">3</span>
          <span><strong>Swapping:</strong> Positions exchange kar dena.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-focusBg border border-focusBorder text-focusText font-extrabold text-xs flex items-center justify-center">4</span>
          <span><strong>One Pass:</strong> Ek full round trip me bada item end tak le jana.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-focusBg border border-focusBorder text-focusText font-extrabold text-xs flex items-center justify-center">5</span>
          <span><strong>Repeat until Sorted:</strong> Process repeat karna tab tak jab tak 0 swaps ho!</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="pt-4">
      <a
        href="/learn/list-basics"
        class="btn-primary px-9 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-lg shadow-chalk inline-flex items-center gap-2"
      >
        <span>Let's Start Module 1</span>
        <span>🚀</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
